      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Geffen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Geffen Tower is found"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "in the center of the city."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "The Wizard Guild is at the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "top, and there's even a dungeon"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "underneath it. There's many a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "mystery surrounding that tower..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Geffen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Please ask me to ''Remove"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Marks from Mini-Map'' if you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "no longer wish to have the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "location marks displayed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "on your Mini-Map."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Geffen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Advances in sorcery and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "technology have allowed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "us to update our information"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "system, enabling up to mark"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "locations on your Mini-Map"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "for easier navigation."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Geffen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Your Mini-Map is located"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "in the upper right corner"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "of the screen. If you can't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "see it, press the Ctrl + Tab"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "keys or click the ''Map'' button in your Basic Info Window."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Geffen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "On your Mini-Map,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "click on the ''+'' and ''-''"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "symbols to zoom in and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "our of your Mini-Map. We"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "hope you enjoy your travels"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "here in the city of Geffen."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
